{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor fired the workspace early, asked targeted questions, explicitly tiered BI‑RADS 4B above thyroid/other findings, addressed the patient’s agreement confusion, and returned a safe stratified plan with teach-back. However the trajectory terminated with a runtime error before completing the pre-procedure safety-boundary conversation (RC5) and without confirming receipt/teach-back at the episodically-gated closure point (RC7), leaving those two responsibility-chain items partially handled. That constitutes a minor in-chain omission, capping the grade at 2.",
